      "summary": "<p>Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes will once again go to war with the vicious Drew McIntyre.</p><p>CM Punk will go one-on-one against Jey Uso for the vacant World Heavyweight Championship at Saturday Night's Main Event.</p><p>Tiffany Stratton will once again defend the WWE Women's Championship against Jade Cargill. </p><p>Dominik Mysterio will be forced to defend his Intercontinental Championship against Rusev and Penta in a Triple Threat Match.</p>",
