        "average": 7.7
      },
      "image": null,
      "summary": "<p>At Saturday Night's Main Event, John Cena's Farewell Tour will come to an end when he goes head-to-head with Gunther. </p><p>Oba Femi recaptured the NXT Championship from Ricky Saints in an instant classic at NXT Deadline, setting the stage for a clash with Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes in what will be Femi's first bout on the main roster. </p><p>World Tag Team Champions AJ Styles and Dragon Lee will battle two of the hottest prospects in NXT, the explosive Je'Von Evans and TNA X Division Champion Leon Slater. </p><p>Saturday Night's Main Event will play host to an incredible matchup between Monday Night Raw's Bayley and NXT's Sol Ruca.</p>",
      "_links": {
