      "runtime": 121,
      "rating": {
        "average": 7
      },
      "image": null,
      "summary": "<p>Rhea Ripley and IYO SKY face their first test as WWE Women's Tag Team Champions as they take on The Judgment Day's Liv Morgan and Roxanne Perez.</p><p>Cody Rhodes and Jacob Fatu will bring their animosity to the ring at Saturday Night's Main Event.</p><p>The next challenger to Undisputed WWE Champion Drew McIntyre will be decided at Saturday Night's Main Event in a Fatal 4-Way Match between Randy Orton, Sami Zayn, Damian Priest and Solo Sikoa.</p>",
